  "worked_solution": "To divide powers of the same base, we simply subtract the exponents:\n\n$$\n{(\\frac{1}{3})}^{7}÷{(\\frac{1}{3})}^{2}={(\\frac{1}{3})}^{7-2}={(\\frac{1}{3})}^{5}\n$$",
